  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A block of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> and charge <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math> is released on a long smooth inclined plane. Magnetic field <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is constant, uniform and out of the plane of the paper as shown. Find the time from the start when blocking lose contact with the surface.<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0069_e37b6b1a8fa7.png\" style=\"width: 154px; height: 161px;\" /></p>\r"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>cosθ</mi></mrow><mi>qB</mi></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mtext> cosec&nbsp;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow><mi>qB</mi></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>cotθ</mi></mrow><mi>qB</mi></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>tanθ</mi></mrow><mi>qB</mi></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Block will lose contact with surface when force due to magnetic field will become equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>mgcos&#952;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>qvB</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>mgcos&#952;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>mgcos&#952;</mi><mi>qB</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>at</mi></math>&nbsp;( along inclined plane )<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>mgcos&#952;</mi><mi>qB</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mtext>&#160;sin</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mfrac><mrow><mtext>m&#160;cot</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow><mi>qB</mi></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
